      "text": "Figure 4: Training curves across 1750 RL steps comparing SFT-Only and SFT+Slerp initialization. (a) RL Reward shows both approaches converging to ~0.9. (b) RL Entropy shows SFT+Slerp maintaining higher entropy (~0.6 vs ~0.5), indicating enhanced exploration and resistance to entropy collapse.",
